          "source_id": "P009",
          "role": "CONTEXT"
        }
      ],
      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P010 supplies the hypothesis-testing rationale and explicit non-assumption; P009 identifies the proposed concurrency reduction."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C015.signal_basis",
    "value": "Apply and hold a known lower concurrency limit while keeping worker version and other controllable settings fixed. Observe actual concurrency and subsequent queue, completion-rate, and phase-duration responses against baseline and any unchanged comparison pool. Improved object-read or upload durations after actual concurrency falls, relative to comparable baseline and control work, support sensitivity to contention.",
    "scope": "A hypothesis test within the tested cohort, concurrency range, versions, and operating conditions. Disturbances and shared-resource contamination can distort the response; no detectable change does not exclude contention.",
